        "collapsible_tab_64B6jP": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Includes",
            "content": "<p>This value pack includes one sheet set and one cooling eye mask, and they will be shipped separately.</p><p><strong>Twin/Twin XL: </strong>1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, 1 Pillowcase, 1 Cooling Eye Mask</p><p><strong>Full/Queen/King/Cal King: </strong>1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, 2 Pillowcases, 1 Cooling Eye Mask</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_rmVpDh": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p><strong>Breescape. Built to sleep through.</strong></p><p>Experience all-night relief with a bundle that cools where it counts.Both the sheet set and cooling eye mask are powered by our patented BlendTek™ technology—delivering instant coolness, breathable softness, and moisture-wicking comfort from head to toe.</p><p></p><p><strong>More Comfort</strong></p><p>Every sheet size—from Twin to King—is up to 15.3% larger than standard, providing full coverage.</p><p><strong>Secure, Light-Blocking Fit</strong></p><p>The cooling eye mask features an adjustable strap and ergonomic shape that stays in place—no slipping, no pressure, and no light getting in.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gentle on Skin</strong></p><p>OEKO-TEX® certified for safe, skin-friendly comfort — ideal even for the most sensitive skin.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        },
